# FinRobot configuration
#
# FinRobot is configured IN THE APP. Open Settings and fill in your LLM provider
# API key, model, data-source keys (FMP / Finnhub) and SEC identity. They are
# stored securely on this machine — the OS keychain for secrets, plus
# ~/.finrobot/settings.json for non-secret choices.
#
# There is NO .env-based configuration for API keys, model selection, or SEC
# identity. The app does not read a .env file or FINROBOT_* environment variables
# for them, so anything pasted below is IGNORED — and a real key must never be
# committed here. This file exists only to document the handful of advanced ops
# knobs that are still read from REAL environment variables (not from this file).
#
# Advanced / ops only — export these in your shell if you need them:
#
#   FINROBOT_SKILLS_DIR=                         # override the bundled skills directory
#   FINROBOT_CACHE_DB_PATH=                      # override the data-cache sqlite path
#   FINROBOT_BACKTEST_STRATEGY_MODULE_PREFIXES=  # comma-separated import prefixes that
#                                                # may load custom backtest Strategy classes
#                                                # (security gate; empty = built-ins only)
#   FINROBOT_DEV_MODE=1                          # force the file-based secret store
#                                                # instead of the OS keychain (dev/CI)
